@startuml protocol-event-changes
!include astah-style.iuml
title Event-ændringer (planlagt)

participant "Ingestion-server" as Ing
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Processing-server" as Proc
participant "Dashboard" as Dash

Ing -> Proc : 1: HTTP GET /events/active
Proc --> Ing : 2: HTTP 200 JSON List<Event(eventId, name, startTime, endTime,\nsendIntervalSeconds, area, zones)>
note left of Ing : Ved opstart

Dash -> Proc : 3: Opret, ret eller slet event eller zone
alt event oprettet
    Proc ->> MQ : 3.1: AMQP basic.publish("event-changes", "event.created")\nJSON EventCreated(eventId, name, startTime, endTime, sendIntervalSeconds, area, zones)
    MQ ->> Ing : 3.2: AMQP basic.deliver JSON EventCreated(...)
else event eller zone ændret
    Proc ->> MQ : 3.1: AMQP basic.publish("event-changes", "event.updated")\nJSON EventUpdated(eventId, name, startTime, endTime, sendIntervalSeconds, area, zones)
    MQ ->> Ing : 3.2: AMQP basic.deliver JSON EventUpdated(...)
else event slettet
    Proc ->> MQ : 3.1: AMQP basic.publish("event-changes", "event.deleted")\nJSON EventDeleted(eventId)
    MQ ->> Ing : 3.2: AMQP basic.deliver JSON EventDeleted(eventId)
end

note over Ing, Dash : Planlagt – ikke implementeret endnu.\nEndpoints mellem dashboard og processing-server er ikke aftalt.\nEn ændring skal nå ingestion-server inden for 30 sekunder (ID-35).

@enduml
